The [[Blue Sage Collar]] is a [[Ranger]] [[Accessory]] which is an upgrade of the [[Acorn Collar]]. Normally obtained by combining the [[Acorn Collar]] with a [[Mana Orb]], the other upgrades of the [[Acorn Collar]] (the [[Red Orchid Collar]] and [[White Lily Collar]]) can also be converted to the [[Blue Sage Collar]] in the same way.

Like all collar items, it cares about {{icon/luck}}, in this case giving the weapons around it a 7% chance to gain 3 {{icon/mana}} for each {{icon/luck}} per {{icon/star}} weapon hit. 

Faster-attacking, low stamina weapons may be most optimal for maximum {{icon/mana}} generation.

The [[Acorn Ace]] skill gives the [[Blue Sage Collar]] and the other collars more {{icon/star}} slots.
